        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 37,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "But neither he, nor his servants, nor the people of the land, listened to the LORD’s words, which he spoke by the prophet Jeremiah.",
      "ko": "그와 그 신하와 그 땅 백성이 여호와께서 선지자 예레미야로 하신 말씀을 듣지 아니하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e0a6b27d744608a0b0e07ffd9699eccf50847f452f43da912ae3c481dfcf3a20",
      "translation_text_hash": "cc7677672a24bdc25b26c7a6dca011a85257ed4c9a2de7beb08873ac519e57c5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
