      "en": "Now Jeremiah came in and went out among the people, for they had not put him into prison.",
      "ko": "때에 예레미야가 갇히지 아니하였으므로 백성 가운데 출입하는 중이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "3f03e6395df5bdfd0eac38752d03be46568b7353799ba6143bccae6ecc448076",
      "translation_text_hash": "750185a15658be42c5e8cf4ee8808806611accb56747644a6d50b823efb9da84",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
