      "en": "Then the LORD’s word came to the prophet Jeremiah, saying,",
      "ko": "여호와의 말씀이 선지자 예레미야에게 임하여 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "58b08a2160b4242f6d71218974ff3980c9e0f473a1220f979e7ccf0903c47cf4",
      "translation_text_hash": "854e2bbef246d90c746cabbda8e9936e2ec7fb8681ac6384f2cf79fb3446293f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와의 말씀이 선지자 예레미야에게 임하여 가라사대"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "854e2bbef246d90c746cabbda8e9936e2ec7fb8681ac6384f2cf79fb3446293f"
      ]
    },
    {
