      "en": "The Chaldeans will come again, and fight against this city. They will take it and burn it with fire.”’",
      "ko": "갈대아인이 다시 와서 이 성을 쳐서 취하여 불사르리라",
      "source_text_hash": "ab5e8dd5f5255a026d2dfff9612635313ffe552420a9eb0c8646571cf0a78a77",
      "translation_text_hash": "8c3becd149bdd0d8ae5d5641a59562b56fa88736c97dba2974a579b0602d5bbb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
