      "en": "Then Jeremiah said, “That is false! I am not defecting to the Chaldeans.” But he didn’t listen to him; so Irijah seized Jeremiah, and brought him to the princes.",
      "ko": "예레미야가 가로되 망령되다 나는 갈대아인에게 항복하려 하지 아니하노라 이리야가 듣지 아니하고 예레미야를 잡아 방백들에게로 끌어가매",
      "source_text_hash": "d6d418b642e6923464c4808f52086d55b3025305926547dbc6980a8955e21724",
      "translation_text_hash": "c9a3a864bff2ce8bfd64f6e1794ea75ff0c8503fc2545fd51c618ece9cff97ba",
