      "en": "When Jeremiah had come into the dungeon house and into the cells, and Jeremiah had remained there many days,",
      "ko": "예레미야가 토굴 옥 음실에 들어간지 여러날만에",
      "source_text_hash": "47b49ebbbb14afb462822d11a2f960de85e5947af00fc7165fad6584afdcf421",
      "translation_text_hash": "099b80f2ea777ae38873c921c17fd58ff63fd1c59c7b3e9e0c7d1d5af8978fe4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
